# The-Black-Curse
A heavy rain poured down the city, drenching every open areas with a hiss.
Boots splashing as two figures running by the empty terrace, sprinting into the blinding rain as they reached for the mansions massive ajar gate. Stepping with a hurried boot, they pushed the thick wooden door open as they entered the quiet building. Wet and exhausted.
The boy with a green raincoat; Chuck, panting as he gasped for air from his constant running. The girl with a yellow raincoat on the other hand; Marie, was squeezing the water out from her damp hair.
